on the scene. The dispatcher cannot simply ignore a frantic 911 call, but they also can't treat a

04:27.160 --> 04:33.620
civilian's panicked estimate of, you know, 10 cars on fire as an absolute verified ground truth yet.

04:34.040 --> 04:35.760
They are holding an unsettled claim.

04:36.360 --> 04:41.960
And if they dispatch five heavy rescue units and a hazmat team based purely on an unverified call,

